<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the</p>
<p>Australian Hardcourt tennis championships at Memorial Drive on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>5-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Thomas Johannson (Sweden) 6-4 3-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) - default</p>
<p>Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) beat Patrick Rafter (Australia) 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (15-13)</p>
<p>4-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
